goldens: opnode re-render (CP-0.7 exit-gate row; composite-level
revision per the fired composite-door tripwire, O-QA goldens round)
producer: appname_conformance::opnode_goldens::produce — fixed
envelope ids; doc.new 64x64 white -> layer.add -> fill ->
smartobject.convert -> layer.duplicate -> edit_contents (blue
fixture fixtures/w16/blue-64.png) -> undo -> redo ->
filter.smart_add (filter.custom dyadic single-tap (+2,0) shift
kernel on the TOPMOST instance DUP — chosen premise-real: a
chain on covered SOL, or a blur on the uniform proxy, would
composite to nothing) ->
adjustment.add (unmasked invert, top of stack); surfaces are
the smart layers' cached composites (LE f32 RGBA over bounds);
composites are the full-canvas render-door output
(composite_document_with over the engine's own op registry,
LE f32 RGBA over the canvas rect)
scope: COMPOSITE level (the former QA-F8 surface-level scope
pin is LIFTED — finding closed in reports/O-QA-log.md,
goldens-round entry; surface goldens unchanged from the
surface-level revision)
